                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Terrible terrible game, abandoned by the devs it seems and the game is a buggy mess. the game tries to emulate games like Sega Soccer Slam or Mario Strikers but fails horribly even for the cheap price.\n\n- full of bugs, many of them requires restarting the game.\n- unresponsive controls, terrible A.I. and horrible input lag.\n- sometimes goals won't count, sometimes goal kicks count as goals..etc.\n\nstay away from this game at all costs and do yourself a favor by playing your old Sega Soccer slam or Mario Strikers games (or at least use an emulator to play them).",
